<div class="gate-doc">
  <%= link_to "whoami", root_path, class: "wordmark" %>
  <h1 class="display">Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="updated">Last updated <%= Date.today.to_fs(:long) %></p>
  <div class="prose">
<h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
<p>
We collect information you provide when creating an account, such as your name, email, and profile details.
We also collect analytics data such as link clicks and profile visits to improve your experience.
</p>


<h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
<p>
Your information is used to provide and improve our services, personalize your profile, and analyze usage trends.
We never sell your data to third parties.
</p>


<h2>3. Data Sharing</h2>
<p>
We may share information only with trusted service providers (such as hosting and analytics) to help operate Whoami.
These providers are bound by strict confidentiality obligations.
</p>


<h2>4. Cookies</h2>
<p>
Whoami uses cookies to remember your preferences and analyze traffic. You can disable cookies in your browser settings, though some features may not work properly.
</p>


<h2>5. Your Rights</h2>
<p>
You can update or delete your account at any time on your dashboard </p>


<h2>6. Changes</h2>
<p>
We may update this Privacy Policy occasionally. If significant changes are made, we’ll notify you by email or through the app.
</p>
  </div>
</div>
